  "text_md": "N O N - H A R D E N I N G P U T T Y\n\n# SSP Putty & Putty Pads\n\nSpecSeal® SSP Firestop Putty excels at sealing cabling penetrations and outlet boxes. SSP Putty is non-hardening and easily hand works around grouped cabling penetrations forming a re-enterable seal allowing for future work. When applied to outlet boxes, SSP Putty easily works into voids and seams forming a continuous seal against fire, smoke, and hot gases.\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\n## Features & Benefits\n\n- • Available in bars or preformed pads\n- • Remains pliable and workable for the lifetime of the installation\n- • Acoustically tested\n- • Will not harden over time\n\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile2.png>)\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile3.png>)\n\n![](<105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1_images/imageFile4.png>)\n\n### ORDERING INFORMATION\n\nCatalog Number UPC Number Size (EOM) Qty. Case Qty. Weight (Each)\n\nSSP100 730573021057 36 in3 (0.6 liter) bar 1 6 2.22 lbs (1.01 kg) SSP28 730573021019 24 in3 (0.4 liter) bar 1 1 1.42 lbs (0.64 kg) SSP4S 73057302200 7.25” x 7.25” x 3/16” (184 mm x 184 mm x 4.8 mm) pad 1 20 0.64 lbs (0.29 kg) SSP9S 73057302300 9.00” x 9.00” x 3/16” (229 mm x 229 mm x 4.8 mm) pad 1 20 0.85 lbs (0.39 kg)\n\nTEST STANDARDS: ASTM E814 (UL 1479), CAN/ULC-S115, UL263\n\nRed Color\n\nRe-Enterable Solution\n\n##### ACOUSTICAL\n\n62\n\nSTC\n\n(Relates to specific construction)\n\n#### 1-800-992-1180 stifirestop.com\n\nClick here to learn more about\n\nZSTI3535 02020\n\n",
